        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b8c1dcec-4979-5674-8224-4e90497a5a2f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Orlando, Florida; Downtown Orlando; West Lakes neighborhoods\n- Venues: Camping World Stadium; Orlando Citrus Bowl; Orlando City Stadium; Amway Center; Dr. Phillips Center for the Performing Arts\n- Sports Teams: Orlando City SC; Orlando Pride\n- Organizations: Major League Soccer; National Women's Soccer League; National Football League\n- Events: 2017 Pro Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- Camping World Stadium, also known as the Orlando Citrus Bowl, is a stadium in Orlando, Florida.\n- Camping World Stadium is in the West Lakes neighborhoods of Downtown Orlando, west of the Amway Center, the Dr. Phillips Center for the Performing Arts, and Orlando City Stadium.\n- Orlando City SC entered Major League Soccer as an expansion franchise in 2015.\n- Orlando City Stadium is the home venue of Orlando City SC and its National Women's Soccer League sister club, Orlando Pride.\n- The 2017 Pro Bowl was the National Football League's all-star game for the 2016 season.\n- The 2017 Pro Bowl was played at Camping World Stadium in Orlando, Florida, on January 29, 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "c587c87d-e61a-54d7-b65d-c2817647ff43",
        "text": "Page: Camping World Stadium. Sentence: Camping World Stadium, also known as the Orlando Citrus Bowl, is a stadium located in Orlando, Florida.\nPage: Camping World Stadium. Sentence: The stadium is located in the West Lakes neighborhoods of Downtown Orlando, west of new sports and entertainment facilities including the Amway Center, the Dr. Phillips Center for the Performing Arts and the Orlando City Stadium.\nPage: Orlando City Stadium. Sentence: It is the home venue for the Orlando City SC, which entered Major League Soccer (MLS) as an expansion franchise in 2015, and their National Women's Soccer League (NWSL) sister club, the Orlando Pride.\nPage: 2017 Pro Bowl. Sentence: The 2017 Pro Bowl (branded as the 2017 Pro Bowl presented by Aquafina for sponsorship reasons) was the National Football League's all-star game for the 2016 season which was played at Camping World Stadium in Orlando, Florida on January 29, 2017.",
